sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Branch / Admin user
    participant P as Bank panel
    participant A as Core: Auth module
    participant C as ARcaptcha
    participant AAA as AAAService (SOAP)
    participant G as Gateway token server
    participant PI as personnelInfo (via Gateway)
    participant DB as Oracle
    U->>P: username, password, solve captcha
    P->>A: POST /api/auth/bank/login (username, password, captcha token)
    A->>C: POST /api/arcaptcha/api/verify (bank site_key, secret_key)
    alt success false, or ARcaptcha down
        C-->>A: error-codes / timeout
        A-->>P: 400 solve captcha again, or 503 (fail closed)
    end
    C-->>A: success true
    A->>AAA: GetRoleWindows (WS-Security UsernameToken of technical account, user name + password)
    alt DetailError present
        AAA-->>A: DetailError[]
        A-->>P: 401 wrong username or password
    end
    AAA-->>A: UserRoles[]
    Note over A: Branch to BRANCH, Admin to ADMIN, other roles ignored. None mapped gives 403.
    A->>G: client_credentials (only if cached token is missing or near expiry)
    G-->>A: access_token (7200 s)
    A->>PI: POST GetOverallPersonelInfo {accountName without @sb24.ir}
    alt 404 not found, or 5xx / timeout
        PI-->>A: error
        A-->>P: login refused (no user enters without a branch)
    end
    PI-->>A: userInfo.abrnchcod, prsnCode, position, job
    A->>DB: upsert app_user, audit LOGIN
    A-->>P: access token 15 min + refresh token 8 h {role, branch_code}
